00:12:08.060 --> 00:12:19.440
Like, Cabal is a third-person shooter where you hide behind walls and have your crosshairs

00:12:19.440 --> 00:12:25.300
targeting at enemies, and those walls are only good for so long, and your firepower

00:12:25.300 --> 00:12:26.200
is good forever.

00:12:26.200 --> 00:12:35.180
